#: src/admin/pages/settings-site.tsx
msgid "Serve \"{prefix}\" at the root again?\n"
"\n"
"Every URL of the default language moves (/{prefix}/about becomes /about) and each old URL, lists, tags and /{prefix} included, redirects to its new one. The navigation's links to this site are rewritten to match."
msgstr "让“{prefix}”重新在根路径下提供？\n"
"\n"
"默认语言的所有 URL 都会迁移（/{prefix}/about 变为 /about），每个旧 URL（包括列表页、标签页和 /{prefix}）都会重定向到新地址。导航中指向本站的链接会同步改写。"

#: src/admin/pages/settings-site.tsx
msgid "Serve \"{prefix}\" under /{prefix}/ too?\n"
"\n"
"Every URL of the default language moves (/about becomes /{prefix}/about) and each old URL, lists and tags included, redirects to its new one. The navigation's links to this site are rewritten to match. The site's root then only redirects to /{prefix}."
msgstr "让“{prefix}”也在 /{prefix}/ 下提供？\n"
"\n"
"默认语言的所有 URL 都会迁移（/about 变为 /{prefix}/about），每个旧 URL（包括列表页和标签页）都会重定向到新地址。导航中指向本站的链接会同步改写。之后站点根路径只会重定向到 /{prefix}。"

